<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 850 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 850 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 600 million zlotys, the whole amount of first ever offered one-day NBP-bills and the entire 250-million-zloty offer of 91-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The bank sold one-day paper at an average rate of 15.20 percent.</p>
<p>The bank sold 91-day bills at an average rate of 21.85 percent, up from 21.67 percent on the last auction on December 27.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
